# Route from the Polestar route simulator's Horde consensus (Tauren export),
# visits 44-48, levels 45.9-47.6. Checked by lint, not play-tested on
# Forever yet. Era + known Forever quests only.
#
# Flow: Camp Mojache (where the previous guide ends) -> fly Gadgetzan
# (bind) -> Sandsorrow Watch -> Gadgetzan -> Caliph Scorpidsting -> Marvon
# Rivetseeker -> the Noxious Lair -> Dunemaul Compound -> Thistleshrub
# Valley -> Tooga's escort to Steamwheedle Port -> Gadgetzan -> Marvon ->
# Scrimshank's gear (OOX-17/TN if you found its beacon) -> Tanaris Field
# Sampling -> Gadgetzan -> the boat from Steamwheedle Port to Powderfuse Port
# and the ride into the Searing Gorge by its eastern pass -> the Grimesilt Dig
# Site -> Thorium Point (flight path) -> Velarok Windblade and the Cauldron
# -> the Slag Pit -> the lava spiders -> the Lookouts -> Thorium Point,
# where the next guide flies on to Stonard.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Tanaris: Sandsorrow Watch first, so Noxious Lair Investigation (82) is
#   in hand for the western loop; Marvon's Gahz'ridian ornaments are dug up
#   on that loop and handed in on the second trip south, with Scrimshank's
#   gear. Tooga is walked straight from Thistleshrub Valley to Steamwheedle
#   Port, where Screecher Spirits (3520) is handed in too.
# - The Blasted Lands pass (visit 45, Threat From the Sea) is gone: the
#   previous guide finishes that chain at Misty Reed Post.
# - The Badlands loop (visit 47) is dropped: a long ride from Kargath to
#   the far south-west for Broken Alliances (782, 3,600 XP) and to the far
#   north for Reclaimed Treasures (2342, no longer accepted on this route).
#   The Kargath bind and both hearths to Kargath go with it.
# - Caught! (4449) is taken, done and handed in on the way into the gorge
#   from Kargath, instead of being carried through the whole zone; Thorium
#   Point's flight path then replaces the hearth out.
# - Gadgetzan on arrival: Tran'rek and the poster beside the wind rider
#   master first, then Andi Lynn, the inn and Marin; Fizzledowser on the west
#   side last, on the way out.
#
# Zul'Farrak (`when dungeon "Zul'Farrak"`, dungeons in the route): for a character who runs it, Gadgetzan's first stop
# takes Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle's Divino-matic Rod (2768, level 47, 1 over here), and Tran'rek's Scarab Shells and
# Trenton Lighthammer's Troll Temper (2865, 3042) for whoever did not take them in 40-50/02-feralas; the run follows
# Sandsorrow Watch, the route's nearest point to the city's gate (about 400 yards north), at about 46, and the three
# are handed in in Gadgetzan after Fizzledowser (`when complete`). The every-quest route (`when dungeon "Zul'Farrak"
# all`): Yeh'kinya takes the screecher spirits in Steamwheedle Port before the run and gives The Prophecy of Mosh'aru
# (3527), handed in when Tooga's escort reaches the port; Tabetha's Tiara of the Deep (2846, taken in the marsh in
# 40-50/03-feralas) goes back by a flight to Brackenwall Village and back; Wizzle Brassbolts' Gahz'rilla (2770,
# from the Mirage Raceway in 40-50/02-feralas) is for a group with a Mallet of Zul'Farrak, which the route doesn't
# make, and goes back to the raceway. Left out: The Spider God (2936: after Master Gadrin's chain, whose Venom
# Bottles and Venom Sac are in the Hinterlands, which the route reaches after this run: a second run).
#
# Optional: Find and Rescue OOX-17/TN! (351, 648): the beacon is a rare
# drop; the reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay. The Key to Freedom
# (4451): the key is a rare drop.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient
# (2641: the Violet Tragan grows in the Hinterlands), Rise of the Silithid
# (32, Orgrimmar around 50), Return to Apothecary Zinge (864, the Undercity
# around 52), The Super Egg-O-Matic (2741: the egg in southern Feralas and the
# hand-in at Gadgetzan, both at the end of forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara).
#
# Class training: none in this guide or the next. Every class trains next in
# Orgrimmar at about 50 (40-50/06; Druids and Paladins in Thunder Bluff); the
# Undercity's classes trained there at about 40 and 45 (40-50/01, 40-50/03).
#
# Left out: Into the Field (243: no longer accepted on this route), Ledger
# from Tanaris (4450: the export never hands it in), Broken Alliances (782),
# see above.

