step OOX-17/TN
  tip Only with the distress beacon: OOX-17/TN sits south-east of Scrimshank's hive. Escort it north to Steamwheedle Port; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay.
  tip Careful: The escort has two ambushes. Three level 47 scorpids attack near the start. Near the end, by the beach, three Wastewander humans attack: one mage and two assassins, around level 44.
  accept 351 optional
  turnin 351 optional                   -- Homing Robot OOX-17/TN
  accept 648 optional
  complete 648 optional

step Tanaris Field Sampling
  tip Back north, just south of Gadgetzan, use the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source now: the two-hour timer starts. The Blisterpaw Hyenas, Glasshide Basilisks and Scorpid Hunters share the dunes here. Each can drop an untested sample: use it, and it either passes as an acceptable one or is lost. Keep killing until you have eight of each.
  accept 654                            -- Use the Model 4711-FTZ Power Source
  collect 9441 quest 654.2 @50.2,31.6 map 1446
  collect 9440 quest 654.1 @49.4,31.0 map 1446
  collect 9438 quest 654.3 @53.2,31.2 map 1446

