# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To the Searing Gorge

step The Grimesilt Dig Site
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip From Powderfuse Port, ride into the Searing Gorge by its eastern pass, then west to the dig site. The Wooden Outhouse stands at its southern end; the Dark Iron Geologists dig just north of it. Bring 15 Silk Cloth (the Auction House sells it).
  accept 4449 object 173265             -- the Wooden Outhouse
  kill 5839 quest 4449.1
  collect 4306 quest 4449.2
  turnin 4449 object 173265

