step The Steamsmiths' furnaces
  tip The Dark Iron Steamsmiths work the furnaces in the middle of the Cauldron; half of them carry a Thorium Plated Dagger, one in ten the Smithing Tuyere. Slaves, Slavers and Taskmasters carry daggers too.
  collect 10551 quest 3443.1
  collect 18959 quest 7728.1

step Velarok Windblade
  turnin 3443
  note His next request needs the Symbol of Ragnaros from elite cultists: leave it.

step Dark Iron Lookouts
  tip The Dark Iron Lookouts stand on the ridges around the sentry towers south of the Cauldron; about one in ten carries the Lookout's Spyglass.
  collect 18960 quest 7728.2

step The Key to Freedom
  tip Only with the Grimesilt Outhouse Key: back east to the Wooden Outhouse at the dig site.
  accept 4451 optional
  turnin 4451 optional object 173265

